{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Before I can file anything, I need to know what we're building — the repo is empty, so this first mission is purely the foundation (a booting skeleton + a working test runner + one thin slice that proves they're wired together), not the product itself. In plain language: what do you want this project to be?","recommended":"Tell me the core idea in a sentence or two — e.g. 'a web app that tracks my running workouts' — and I'll steer us toward a concrete stack from there."},"prd":"# Mission: <pending — foundation for a new project>\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** Stand up the project foundation — a booting skeleton, a working test system, and one thin vertical slice proving both are connected.\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- _to be filled in during Align_\n**Out of Scope:**\n- Building the product's actual features (recorded and deferred to the project vision)\n**Constraints:**\n- _stack to be recommended and confirmed with the captain_\n"}

